      "writtenOn": "2018-09-28T19:00:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not overly familiar with architecture. But, is there concern over atomicity of read-modify-write logic on the KV store with multiple threads calling get_resource_id() or free_resource_id() concurrently?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 0,
