        "id": 1000127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-30T14:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The adapter and its calls to to KV store get executed in the Twisted Reactor which is single threaded. The calls to KV store are blocking and hence there is no problem of any corruption.",
