        "id": 1000127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-30T14:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "True, this case is not handled. To start with, have assumed that all OLTs of a given OLT vendor have the same resource ranges. \nGiven that the logical device ID for a given OLT device doesn\u0027t change, resource ranges can be defined per OLT with LogicalDevice ID as the Key. This is something that could addressed in the future.",
      "parentUuid": "c0e53caa_b1b46f64",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 196,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 196,
